230	    /// A system colour as concrete sRGB in the view's appearance: TextKit 2
231	    /// draws a dynamic colour (`labelColor`) into a `CGContext` as nothing
232	    /// (measured, TX-S2), so the text is styled with resolved colours and
233	    /// restyled when the appearance changes.
